# BIT-1's Grow, Song: the first song cut to its first four positions, then grown to 32 around them (Style
# Song, its third knob the length); it plays through, and still packs into its flash object
wait 500
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap SEQ
expect view 1
spin K3 -12
expect par4 4
tap ARP
expect view 7
spin K1 14
wait 200
shot song_grow.png
tap EDIT
expect par4 32
expect dirty 1
expect packed <3840
tap SEQ
wait 300
shot song_grown.png
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect playing 1
expect rows >60
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
